1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,220
The monitors were my lifestyle

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,740
The shadows creeping in

3
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:10,500
The doctors whispered numbers

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:13,700
Where the ending should begin

5
00:00:13,700 --> 00:00:16,900
Stage four tried to take it all

6
00:00:17,780 --> 00:00:20,820
And bury what was left

7
00:00:20,820 --> 00:00:24,180
I looked death right in the eyes

8
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:26,980
And stole away his breath

9
00:00:26,980 --> 00:00:29,380
