11
00:00:33,700 --> 00:00:39,940
Looking at the doc who's analyzing the appropriate dosage

12
00:00:40,980 --> 00:00:44,020
Stage four on the chart, tearing at the heart

13
00:00:44,020 --> 00:00:47,060
Trying to dismantle the architecture

14
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:50,660
But I am the director of a resurrection

15
00:00:50,660 --> 00:00:54,180
Defying every medical conjecture

16
00:00:54,180 --> 00:00:55,080
They told me it's aggressive, a progressive mess
